-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Why this subtree is licensed differently from the rest of the repository
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

The rest of this repository (the MGU / iDrive 7 app) is public domain (The
Unlicense). This idrive6/ subtree is NOT, because its NBT Evo framework binding
is a derivative work of reverse-engineering published under the PolyForm
Noncommercial License, and must keep a compatible license:

  * MGD4096/IDRIVE_GAUGE_APP        - the native NBT Evo PluginApp this is modeled
    (https://github.com/MGD4096/IDRIVE_GAUGE_APP)   on; framework glue, host-test
                                                    harness, data-build and XML/
                                                    manifest patterns derive from it.
                                                    PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0.

  * Sq00ky/Supra-iDrive6-Android-Auto (NBT-AAD) - the project IDRIVE_GAUGE_APP in
    (https://github.com/Sq00ky/Supra-iDrive6-Android-Auto)  turn derives its RHMI
                                                            PluginApp pattern from.

The pure logic in src/blend.hpp, src/fuel.hpp and src/app_core.hpp is original
work ported from this repository's own MGU app and is also available from there
under The Unlicense; within this subtree it is distributed under the license above
for simplicity.
